package Libraries.Game.Graphics.Vulkan

use Libraries.Game.Graphics.Models.Vulkan.MaterialVulkan
use Libraries.Game.Graphics.Texture
use Libraries.Game.Graphics.Color
use Libraries.Compute.Matrix4

/*
A VulkanInstanceBlock holds the GPU instance data for many copies of one
mesh, packed once in the same layout a VulkanDrawQueue3D writes. The 3D painter keeps one per mesh
of a model with copies,
such as a foliage cell, and copies the whole block into a draw queue each
frame in one move (VulkanDrawQueue3D:AddInstanceBlock), instead of working
out and writing every copy again. It is packed again only when the copies,
the mesh's buffers, its material's buffer, its texture or its color change.

Most programs never use this class directly.

Attribute: Example
use Libraries.Game.Graphics.Vulkan.VulkanInstanceBlock

VulkanInstanceBlock block
block:SetCapacity(100)
*/
class VulkanInstanceBlock
    /*
    This action empties the block and makes room for a number of instances,
    so packing that many makes nothing new.

    Attribute: Parameter count How many instances it should hold.
    */
    system action SetCapacity(integer count)

    /*
    This action empties the block, keeping its room.
    */
    system action Empty

    /*
    This action packs one instance at the end of the block, as a draw
    queue would write it: the mesh's vertex and index buffers, its
    material, an optional texture and color in place of the material's,
    and the instance's transform. The block grows if it is full.

    Attribute: Parameter vertexBuffer The mesh's vertex buffer.
    Attribute: Parameter indexBuffer The mesh's index buffer.
    Attribute: Parameter material The mesh's material.
    Attribute: Parameter texture A texture in place of the material's, or undefined.
    Attribute: Parameter diffuse A color in place of the material's, or undefined.
    Attribute: Parameter transform The instance's transform.
    */
    system action AddInstance(VulkanBuffer vertexBuffer, VulkanBuffer indexBuffer, MaterialVulkan material, Texture texture, Color diffuse, Matrix4 transform)

    /*
    This action returns how many instances are packed.

    Attribute: Returns The count.
    */
    system action GetCount returns integer
end
